note 2026-11-09T14:01:00Z
    **Decision (agent, 2026-11-09):** migration calls (OD54 (2) to (16)): a new method
    `previous[i].retryable(k, { times })`; Flow's own record format with a pure upgrade at boot; a
    removed history-target state resets the record; `flow explain <release> --since <release>`; an
    undecodable record is quarantined, then overwritten at the fresh actor's first save.

    **Why:** writes in flight and data stay honest across a release (rule 74, Q1 A).

    **Reverse:** one rule each; keep quarantined bytes until `forget` for (16).

    **Governs:** @spec.Restore, @spec.WriteLanes, @spec.StaticCli.
